iven","marks":1}]}},{"question_id":"3(iii)","parent_question":3,"topic":"virtual memory statements","marks":4,"command_word":"complete","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The computer has Virtual Memory (VM)."},{"type":"text","value":"The table has four statements about VM. Not all of the statements are correct."},{"type":"text","value":"Tick the True column for the statements that are correct. Rewrite any statement that is incorrect in the False column by changing the statement to make it true."},{"type":"table","headers":["Statement","True","False - rewrite the statement to make it true"],"rows":[["A section of primary storage is partitioned to act as virtual memory","",""],["Data from ROM is transferred into VM","",""],["VM is needed when RAM is full, or nearly full","",""],["Data from VM is transferred back to secondary storage when needed","",""]]}],"answer":{"guidance":"1 mark for each row. Row 1 should be corrected to secondary storage. Row 2 should be corrected to RAM. Row 3 is true. Row 4 should be corrected so data from VM is transferred back to RAM when needed.","marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Row 1 corrected to secondary storage","marks":1},{"criteria":"Row 2 corrected to RAM","marks":1},{"criteria":"Row 3 identified as true","marks":1},{"criteria":"Row 4 corrected so data is transferred back to RAM","marks":1}]}},{"question_id":"4(i)","parent_question":4,"topic":"secondary storage need","marks":2,"command_word":"state","content":[{"type":"text","value":"A smart television has secondary storage."},{"type":"text","value":"State, using an example, why the smart television needs secondary storage."}],"answer":{"guidance":"1 mark for a valid example such as the operating system, web browser software, recorded shows, or user preferences. 1 mark for explaining that the data must be stored permanently or when the television is turned off.","marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"A valid example of data stored on secondary storage is given","marks":1},{"criteria":"It is